#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:5 c666e601a0414153b8d5917e5d6b5f84
msgid "Ornithopters"
msgstr "扑翼机"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:10 56f1a82fefb449339e6e6437a038f831
msgid ""
"Ornithopters differ from conventional airplanes by not having a propeller, "
"but rather flapping wings."
msgstr "扑翼机与传统飞机的不同之处在于没有螺旋桨，而是使用扑动的翅膀。"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:13 0d344eb713d44ae38a1aaeda0db1a9e1
msgid ""
"Ornithopters, especially those that resemble birds, benefit greatly from "
"having the ardupilot system on-board, as this way they can be set to "
"\"patrol an area\", and thus scare off \"flying pests\" such as pigeons, ..."
" (these damage freshly sown fields by eating the seeds planted, also eat "
"fruit such as currants, blueberries, ... )"
msgstr ""
"扑翼机，尤其是那些类似鸟类的扑翼机，搭载 ArduPilot "
"系统后受益颇大，因为这样可以将其设置为「巡逻某区域」，从而驱赶「飞行害虫」，如鸽子等（这些害虫通过食用种子破坏新播种的农田，也吃醋栗、蓝莓等水果）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:19 d90d237e5ee140f3816215733d94e66e
msgid ""
"Ready-to-fly (RTF) ornithopters are not obtainable. Ornithopters can be "
"build, however, using the ornithopter kits from `BirdKit "
"<http://www.birdkit.com/>`__. There are some designs (i.e. Kestrel), you can"
" also print the airframe and wing flapping mechanism using a 3D-printer. "
"`Kazuhiko <https://3dprint.com/82355/3d-printed-ornithopters>`__ provides "
"such 3D-printable files from the `Kazuhiko Kakuta Shapeway shop "
"<http://kakutaclinic.life.coocan.jp/3DPShop.html>`__. The 3D-printable parts"
" need to be combined with the fuselage of other kits (more is explained on "
"`this image <http://kakutaclinic.life.coocan.jp/K31iV3D.jpg>`__, `this excel"
" file <http://kakutaclinic.life.coocan.jp/K313DPL.xls>`__, and these "
"`youtube video's "
"<https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLErvdRrwWuPqYYhMu_lF_OLwPxQd2iphJ>`__."
msgstr ""
"即飞（RTF）扑翼机无法购买到。但可以使用 `BirdKit <http://www.birdkit.com/>`__ "
"的扑翼机套件来制作扑翼机。有一些设计（如 Kestrel），您也可以使用 3D 打印机打印机架和翅膀扑动机构。`Kazuhiko "
"<https://3dprint.com/82355/3d-printed-ornithopters>`__ 从 `Kazuhiko Kakuta "
"Shapeway 商店 <http://kakutaclinic.life.coocan.jp/3DPShop.html>`__ 提供此类 3D "
"可打印文件。3D 打印零件需要与其他套件的机身组合（更多说明见 `此图片 "
"<http://kakutaclinic.life.coocan.jp/K31iV3D.jpg>`__、`此 Excel 文件 "
"<http://kakutaclinic.life.coocan.jp/K313DPL.xls>`__ 和这些 `YouTube 视频 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLErvdRrwWuPqYYhMu_lF_OLwPxQd2iphJ>`__）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:24 03070a6a30f44077a509d584f0feeec4
msgid ""
"You can also try to build an ornithopter from scratch. `Ornithopter.org "
"<http://www.ornithopter.org>`__ has info on how to do this. There's also an "
"`ornithopter gearbox for sale by Birdkit "
"<http://www.birdkit.com/models.gbx.html>`__, and some ornithopter gearboxes "
"can also be found at `shapeways "
"<https://www.shapeways.com/product/M926URRWW/functional-ornithopter>`__."
msgstr ""
"您也可以尝试从头制作扑翼机。`Ornithopter.org <http://www.ornithopter.org>`__ 有关于如何制作的信息。还有"
" `Birdkit 出售的扑翼机齿轮箱 <http://www.birdkit.com/models.gbx.html>`__，以及一些可在 "
"`shapeways <https://www.shapeways.com/product/M926URRWW/functional-"
"ornithopter>`__ 找到的扑翼机齿轮箱。"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:26 869b484769974162a1e1279d5d3b7a84
msgid ""
"At least two ornithopters (GosHawk25iV made by Kazuhiko, and Robird by Clear"
" Flight Solutions) are known to work with an ardupilot autopilot. The "
"`GosHawk25iV <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/ardupilot-on-"
"ornithopter/13871>`__, and the `proprietary Robird "
"<http://essay.utwente.nl/66500/1/Straatman_MA_EEMCS.pdf>`__, so in theory, "
"many ornithopters could be made to work with it."
msgstr ""
"已知至少有两架扑翼机（Kazuhiko 制作的 GosHawk25iV 和 Clear Flight Solutions 的 Robird）可与 "
"ArduPilot 飞控配合使用。`GosHawk25iV <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/ardupilot-on-"
"ornithopter/13871>`__ 和 `专有的 Robird "
"<http://essay.utwente.nl/66500/1/Straatman_MA_EEMCS.pdf>`__，因此理论上许多扑翼机都可以与之配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:30 a754fc38aa6f43b6b16ab330c0e7b780
msgid "Autopilot Setup Differences"
msgstr "飞控设置差异"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:31 6e2e8cbb34594caaa917f4cab8456153
msgid ""
"Fixed wing aircraft generally use 4 control ouputs: aileron, elevator, "
"throttle and rudder."
msgstr "固定翼飞机通常使用 4 个控制输出：副翼、升降舵、油门和方向舵。"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:33 49bbe5704a6d4d74bfb7e0b9a67ac71e
msgid "In Orinthopters, these primary controls are:"
msgstr "在扑翼机中，这些主要控制为："

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:35 ff31e068f0a74790a79aef0beb36c288
msgid ""
"wing ailerons -> `split tail ailerons/elevators "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xTentRRvYM8>`__, for banking."
msgstr ""
"翼副翼 -> `分裂尾翼副翼/升降舵 <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xTentRRvYM8>`__，用于坡度转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:36 d694e30a88d240a2bf6fe6afb9a950d9
msgid ""
"wing elevators -> some (not all) ornithopters have `split tail "
"ailerons/elevators <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xTentRRvYM8>`__, for "
"pitch control."
msgstr ""
"翼升降舵 -> 部分（非全部）扑翼机有 `分裂尾翼副翼/升降舵 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xTentRRvYM8>`__，用于俯仰控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:37 60845a4681b5493788601e7fdc4ac751
msgid "throttle -> wing flapping throttle."
msgstr "油门 -> 翅膀扑动油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:38 95cde910acd249d6aac64c70600bdda7
msgid ""
"(optionally)rudder -> some (ornithopters have a `swinging tail "
"<https://www.ornithopter.org/how.stab.shtml>`__ for yaw control."
msgstr ""
"（可选）方向舵 -> 部分扑翼机有用于偏航控制的 `摆动尾翼 "
"<https://www.ornithopter.org/how.stab.shtml>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:41 01dec06ea3cb46b89d025e3b75a10b28
msgid "Wing Construction"
msgstr "机翼结构"

#: ../../source/docs/ornithopter.rst:43 80a62c68056a429195c95815b2e86fde
msgid ""
"For the wings, they can be built using 3D-printed wing spars (or profiles "
"that fit around a carbon spar. The airfoil profile can be any cambered "
"profile depending on the ornithopter design, and the `exact airfoil "
"<http://www.dcgeorge.com/Falcon12aFeasibilityStudy.html>`__ is usually "
"calculated. The angle of attack is often about `15 degrees "
"<https://www.ornithopter.org/how.wing.shtml>`__."
msgstr ""
"翅膀可以使用 3D 打印的翼梁（或套在碳纤维梁上的型材）来制作。翼型可以是任何拱形型面，取决于扑翼机设计，`精确翼型 "
"<http://www.dcgeorge.com/Falcon12aFeasibilityStudy.html>`__ 通常经过计算。迎角通常约为 "
"`15 度 <https://www.ornithopter.org/how.wing.shtml>`__。"
